{"id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-kripke-model.md","title":"Kripke Model and Satisfaction","display":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model and Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-kripke-model","aliases":["93-df-kripke-model"],"display":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model and Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-kripke-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-kripke-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model and Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(T_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\)</span> are the term-algebra constructor, tagged compound constructor, and atomic-formula set sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li>The tagged connective symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\">\\(\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}\">\\(\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}\\)</span>, the constructors <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\\)</span>, and the modal formula carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> is a model candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{mneg}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,0\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathtt{mand}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,1\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,2\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathtt{mneg}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,0\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathtt{mand}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,1\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle3,2\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\mathtt{mbox}_{93}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{mand}_{93},2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{mbox}_{93},1\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{mand}_{93},2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathtt{mbox}_{93},1\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93},\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93},\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\coloneqq T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\coloneqq T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\langle\\varphi\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mbox}_{93},\\langle\\varphi\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mneg}_{93},\\langle\\varphi\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mand}_{93},\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{App}_{93}(\\mathtt{mbox}_{93},\\langle\\varphi\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93},\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\\cap\\mathrm{At}_{93}=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93},\\operatorname{ar}^{\\Box}_{93})\n\\land\\mathrm{Conn}^{\\Box}_{93}\\cap\\mathrm{At}_{93}=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,R,V\\;\\bigl(\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\land W\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq W^2\\land V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,R,V\\;\\bigl(\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\land W\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq W^2\\land V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists W,R,V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\n\\land S\\subseteq W\\times\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle w,p\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow w\\in V(p)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\notin S\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S\\land\\langle w,\\psi\\rangle\\in S)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle v,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists W,R,V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\n\\land S\\subseteq W\\times\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle w,p\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow w\\in V(p)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\notin S\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S\\land\\langle w,\\psi\\rangle\\in S)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\langle w,\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle v,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\to\\exists!S\\;\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\to\\exists!S\\;\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nw\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,R,V,S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nw\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,R,V,S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{SatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\langle w,\\varphi\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\)</span> is the local free term algebra for exactly the three explicitly tagged modal constructors, structural recursion gives the displayed unique satisfaction relation. It is deliberately distinct from formula carriers belonging to other signatures. This atom defines local satisfaction only; frame validity and semantic consequence require additional universal quantifiers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_{\\tau}(X)$, $\\operatorname{App}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{At}_{93}$ are the te